Theorem bn254_g2_cofactor_primes:
  prime 10069 /\ prime 5864401 /\ prime 1875725156269 /\
  prime 197620364512881247228717050342013327560683201906968909
Proof
  rpt conj_tac >> CONV_TAC cofactor_prime_conv
QED

